  "question": "Can the exact NDL-held 1951 second-half 《文物参考资料》 object containing volume 2 issue 9 be bound to an NDL Digital object or an openly exposed page surrogate through current NDL Search provider APIs?",
  "answer": "The exact NDL paper bound-volume object is re-confirmed, but no current NDL Digital object is exposed. NDL OpenSearch is first calibrated with a positive dpid=ndl-dl query that returns 165 results and direct dl.ndl.go.jp PID references, proving the provider filter is functioning. Against that working control, 1951 《文物参考資料/文物参考资料》 with dpid=ndl-dl returns totalResults=0, the same target with dpid=ndl-dl-open returns 0, and the Zhao Wanli article title in traditional and simplified forms with dpid=ndl-dl also returns 0. Without provider restriction, NDL Search returns the exact paper bound-volume item R100000002-Ia0000051292-i25241426, labelled 2(7)-2(12) 1951. Its public record states material form 紙, call number Z8-AC150, NDL bibliographic ID a0000051292, publisher 文物出版社, and the serial chronology 2巻1期 (1951.1) through 2巻12期 (1951.12). The exact item page exposes no dl.ndl.go.jp or PID link. This closes only the current NDL Digital/provider access route; it does not prove that no digitization exists elsewhere, does not recover wwck195109.pdf, and does not directly review issue 9 or Zhao Wanli pp.221–233.",
